@startuml
!theme vibrant

title Diagrama de Componentes - GameManPrototyope

actor User as "Usuário"

node "Máquina Local" {
    artifact "gameman" as GameManApp
    artifact "logger" as LogServerProcess

    component "GameManager" as GM
    component "LogManager"
    component "LogClient"
    component "LogServer"
}

User --> GameManApp : inicia

GameManApp --> GM : utiliza
GM --> LogManager : para registrar logs

LogManager --> LogClient : utiliza
LogClient ..> LogServerProcess : envia logs (via IPC/Sockets)

LogServerProcess --> LogServer : executa

note right of LogClient
  Comunicação entre processos
  (ex: Sockets, Pipes, etc.)
end note

@enduml
